flowchart TD
  U[User] --> UI[Gradio UI]
  UI --> W[Request and controlled planning workflow]
  W --> LP[Load user preferences from SQLite]
  LP --> VP[Generate and validate request-specific plan]
  VP --> PS[Update plan state: pending / running / completed / failed]
  PS --> AG[LangChain agent and shared tools]
  AG --> T1[Mock flight search]
  AG --> T2[Mock hotel search]
  AG --> T3[Mock attractions]
  AG --> T4[Mock restaurants]
  AG --> T5[Mock weather]
  T1 & T2 & T3 & T4 & T5 --> TR[Record tool results]
  TR --> FI[Personalized itinerary]
  FI --> UI
  subgraph MEMORY[Memory architecture]
    CS[Thread message history in SQLite]
    CP[LangGraph checkpointer concept: thread-scoped state]
    LS[User-specific long-term preference table]
    EP[Optional episodic records of past plans]
    PR[Procedural workflow rules]
    CP -. durable SQLite checkpoint adapter is optional extension .-> CS
  end
  W -. guided by .-> PR
  LP <--> LS
  AG --> EP
  NB[Agent Notebook] --> W
  UI -. shares implementation .-> W
